# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CONTENT QUARANTINE — do not remove.
#
# Third-party, book-derived, and in-flight generated content must never enter
# version control or a shippable build. Packs under content/packs/personal/
# carry licenseTier "personal-only"; the pack builder excludes that tier from
# release artifacts. content/inbox/ is the unverified drop zone for Claude
# Routine / LLM output before `pack verify` gates it.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
content/packs/personal/**
!content/packs/personal/.gitkeep
!content/packs/personal/README.md
content/inbox/**
!content/inbox/.gitkeep
!content/inbox/README.md

# Local user database
*.db
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
